# Options for test_mfma.cu. See test_diag.opt for the format.
#
# Both refusals are deliberate. MFMA operands are register tuples (v[0:3])
# and a vreg here is a single 32-bit register, so the old single-register
# form llvm-mc rejects is no longer emitted; PTX has no MFMA at all.
xfail --amdgpu      MFMA needs register tuples the machine IR cannot express
xfail --nvidia-ptx  MFMA is an AMD intrinsic, PTX wants mma.sync instead
